  "description": "Lycia.Persistence.SqlServer provides a Microsoft SQL Server backed ISagaStore for the\n            Lycia Saga framework:\n            - Durable saga-data and saga-step persistence over Microsoft.Data.SqlClient\n            - Optimistic concurrency (IVersionedSagaStore) via an explicit version column and CAS updates\n            - Service-local atomic SagaStore + Inbox + Outbox transactions for compatible topology\n            - Embedded, self-applying schema migrations (ApplyMigrations/ValidateOnly/Disabled)\n            - Health check integration (ISagaStoreHealthCheck)",
  "id": "Lycia.Persistence.SqlServer",
